Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At SecureTech, we are committed to providing you with the highest level of service and security for your digital assets. We are excited to announce the launch of our new enhanced security features, designed to further protect your account and personal information. Starting next week, all users will have access to the following features: 1. **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)**: We are introducing 2FA as an additional layer of security. You can now enable this feature to ensure that your account is protected even if your password is compromised. Instructions on how to set up 2FA will be available on our website. 2. **Real-Time Security Alerts**: Our new system will notify you of any suspicious activity on your account in real-time. You will receive alerts via email and SMS, allowing you to act quickly if you notice any unauthorized access. 3. **Security Dashboard**: We are launching a user-friendly dashboard that allows you to monitor your account's security status. This dashboard will provide you with insights into your recent activity and any potential vulnerabilities. To facilitate these updates, we will perform scheduled maintenance on our platform from 10 PM to 12 AM (EST) on March 15th. During this time, access to your account may be temporarily unavailable. We appreciate your understanding and patience as we work to improve your experience. If